Class aquilia.i18n.catalog.MemoryCatalog
Module: aquilia.i18n.catalog

Docstring:
In-memory translation catalog backed by nested dicts.

    Ideal for testing, small apps, or programmatic construction.

    Args:
        translations: Dict of ``{locale: {key: value}}``

    Example::

        catalog = MemoryCatalog({
            "en": {
                "messages": {
                    "welcome": "Welcome, {name}!",
                    "items_count": {
                        "one": "{count} item",
                        "other": "{count} items",
                    }
                }
            },
            "fr": {
                "messages": {
                    "welcome": "Bienvenue, {name} !",
                }
            }
        })
